# Culling must not cut walls you can see in iso. Shrinking the arena (L x7: 2000 across) puts
# every wall within 1000 of the cycle; heading south pins it against the south wall, which
# then stands between the camera and the cycle (walls are taller than the camera).
wait 17
# The game starts in 1st person; these steps were written from iso, so switch to it first
press down
wait 0.3
press l 7
press right
press right
wait 3
shot wall_iso_south
# Turn to run west along it, then north to the far wall
press right
wait 2
shot wall_iso_corner
press right
wait 3
shot wall_iso_north
